I wake up in the morning.
It is seven o'clock right now.
It is dark in my room right now.
I get up from my bed.
I go near the window.
I pull back the window curtains.
Suddenly, a lot of light comes into the room.
There is very bright sunlight outside.
The sunlight stings my eyes.
I immediately feel very hot.
My room also becomes hot.
It is very hot today.
There is no wind outside at all.
Today will be a very hot day.
I am sweating.
I turn up the ceiling fan.
I go into the kitchen.
Now I will make my morning coffee.
Then I will check the weather report on the phone.
Will it be this sunny all day today?
